    89 m ≤ 19 Σ_{j=1}^{m-1} α_j + 678          (`walkK7R34C7W16`, C = P L - Q (L - k) + D).

Its telescoped steps i = 0 .. m-9 use the 7-centre windows j = i + 1 (directions j .. j+7, centres
j+1 .. j+7): the m - 8 windows j = 1 .. m-8.  Share premise: for each of the 132 shapes of
`shapesK7R34C7W16`, every such window of that shape has share sum (`windowShareK7R34C7W16`, weights 6/3/2) at least
27.  A vertex is a centre of at most 7 windows (`ShareBonus.sum_windowShareK_le`), and
`weighted_identity_bound` closes the count (`ShareBonus.upper_of_walk_and_shares`):

    111351 m ≤ 25718373,  i.e. m ≤ 230 (230.97).
-/

